# MCQ Practice Service Data Integration

The goal is to synchronize the MCQ practice session data fetching with the question-bank methodology, specifically by including topics and real question counts.

## Proposed Changes

### API Layer

#### [MODIFY] [exam.ts](file:///c:/Users/User/Documents/monorepo-new/packages/api/src/routers/home/exam.ts)
- Update `getSubjectsWithChapters` query to include `topics` within chapters.
- Include MCQ counts for each topic.
- Ensure ordering by `position` instead of `name` where applicable, consistent with [services.ts](file:///c:/Users/User/Documents/monorepo-new/packages/api/src/routers/home/services.ts).

### Frontend Layer

#### [MODIFY] [mcq-practice-service.tsx](file:///c:/Users/User/Documents/monorepo-new/apps/home/modules/services/ui/views/mcq-practice-service.tsx)
- Use real data from the `getSubjectsWithChapters` tRPC query.
- Remove the `subjectsData` mock constant.
- Update `availableChapters`, `availableTopics`, and `totalQuestionsAvailable` to use the schema-defined fields.
- Ensure selection logic (subjects, chapters, topics) works with database IDs.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- N/A

### Manual Verification
1. Navigate to the MCQ practice page.
2. Verify that subjects, chapters, and topics are loaded from the database.
3. Select various items and check if "Total Questions Available" updates correctly.
4. Start a practice session and verify questions are fetched based on selection.
